WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.220
Another thing Dr. Bright is not&nbsp;
allowed to do at the Foundation:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:07.240
Stop telling people you're a wizard!
No matter what Dr. Bright might tell you,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:10.300
what kind of robes he wears,&nbsp;
whether he has a pointy hat&nbsp;

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:14.500
or a walking stick or even a talking&nbsp;
bird on his shoulder, he is not a wizard.&nbsp;

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:19.120
Speaking of birds, Dr. Bright, leave Dr.&nbsp;
Spanko alone. He is not your familiar.

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:23.380
Dr. Bright is not able to perform&nbsp;
any spells, nor can he make potions&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.380 --> 00:00:28.900
aside from his world famous sherbet punch.
That, he is permitted to make. But only for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:32.620
official Foundation holiday parties!
Finally: stop standing in doorways&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:37.218
and declaring "YOU SHALL NOT PASS."
Sir Ian McKellan would not approve.

